Kernel Borderlands
==================

Start:        sudo kbctl up
Dashboard:    kbctl dashboard open        (http://127.0.0.1:8082)
SSH TUI:      sudo kbctl ssh add-key ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub
              kbctl ssh connect
Status/stop:  kbctl status / sudo kbctl down

kb-aads (agent swarm) is optional and not enabled by default:
  python3 -m venv /opt/kb/venv
  /opt/kb/venv/bin/pip install -r /usr/lib/kb/aads/requirements.txt
  sudo systemctl enable --now kbagents

Requires a kernel with BTF and BPF LSM enabled; see
/usr/share/doc/kernel-borderlands/ and docs/architecture/enabling-bpf-lsm.md.
